## 11. Integrated Financing Roadmap for PLN

### 11.1 Short-Term (2024-2025)

| Initiative | Amount | Source | Status |
|------------|--------|--------|--------|
| Green Loans | IDR 12 trillion | National banks | Secured |
| KfW Green Financing | €1.2 billion | Germany | MoU signed |
